{"version":1,"content":"<p>醫委會今日（21日）舉行研訊，註冊醫生梁金豐被控在未提供合理及/或適當理由的情况下，出於同情，為其病人林志文（音譯）簽發共計207天的追溯病假證明，構成專業失當。</p><p>醫委會研訊小組裁決其專業失當成立，判除名6個月，緩刑24個月。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T07:21:29.787731+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T06:26:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T07:57:37.072094+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T07:17:41.357350+00:00","content_hash":"56254c3f8ebc432aeea136bf900c00aebfe8eb35ae69277c381d05dedfc62f9b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}